type: software
title: "MouseSeg: Open Source 3D Mouse Organ and Tumor CT Segmentation in Under 10 Seconds Without GPUs"
abstract: "Open-source 3D murine micro-CT and cone-beam CT segmentation of 10 mouse organs at risk, subcutaneous tumors, and cradle-stripped body masks in under 10 seconds on standard CPUs via ONNX Runtime and WebAssembly."
